{"id":"C06e702c355a348cd6792","zh":"连续小波变换","en":"continuous wavelet transform","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"连续改变尺度和平移位置的小波变换，可用于提取信号的时间—尺度特征。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":"连续小波变换与离散小波变换是不同方法。","usage_overview":"用于分析轨道不平顺及车体振动等信号的局部波形、能量分布，以及局部特征与频率尺度的联系，并为尺度能量谱计算提供基础。其分析采用连续尺度和平移参数，与离散小波变换是不同方法。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C06e702c355a348cd6792","zh":"连续小波变换","en":"continuous wavelet transform","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H2ff749aadd9fcfe7dad4","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2014）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D4e6602511bfe4c2a1d31","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"连续小波变换"},{"id":"D8a522a0fb9b65e2f0864","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"continuous wavelet transform"},{"id":"EM09f56e506f49de94d2e3e7b7","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"连续小波变换"},{"id":"EM828536e5b5914f7f5e45af3e","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"continuous wavelet transform"},{"id":"ED4734247502381ad480728f90","language":"zh","role":"variant","text":"连续小波变换"},{"id":"ED2eb22962a56a631274629f08","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"continuous wavelet transform"}],"sources":{"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"},"P121":{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S1eb03ee940b4c70d11fd","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"根据上述定律与思想,本文采用基于连续小波变换的能量谱方法,对沪宁客运专线和朔黄重载铁路的轨道不平顺及列车振动响应的轨检数据进行时(频)域能量的联合分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sdaba472f87c3290e1f3b","source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于连续小波变换细致的时间-尺度网格划分性能,结合概率方法,通过对轨道不平顺和列车振动信号的能量计算与分析,建立列车振动响应和轨道不平顺信号的时间、尺度和时间-尺度小波能量谱,并进行联合诊断。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S5ee8959200a31f8e9176","source_id":"P121","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"铁道科学与工程学报 JOURNAL OF RAILWAY SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING June 2013 基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析 * 宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸 (中南大学土木工程学院,湖南长沙410075) 摘要:通过选择合适的小波基函数,对轨道不平顺和车体振动加速度信号进行连续小波变换,以小波系数作为平顺状态评价指标进行轨道不平顺时频分析; 同时,将小波尺度系数与车体振动加速度时程曲线进行相关性分析,可以提取对车体振动影响较大的特征频率(段) 。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S3db21d2585cc2ad0b2be","source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文提出基于连续小波变换系数的轨道不平顺时频分析方法,考虑轨道动态几何形变中固定波形的影响,提取轨道不平顺的时频特性,能更为精细地提取轨道不平顺特征时频信号; 同时将对应区段车体振动加速度序列的小波变换时频分析结果与轨道不平顺信号进行比较分析,运用相关性分析方法提取对车体影响较大的特征频率及轨道不平顺类型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P121","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_concept_id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_zh":"车体振动加速度","target_en":"car-body vibration acceleration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd06cae24bbd7f43eb114","target_concept_id":"Cd06cae24bbd7f43eb114","target_zh":"时频分析方法","target_en":"time-frequency analysis method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C213494396007ff4d4abf","target_concept_id":"C213494396007ff4d4abf","target_zh":"特征频率","target_en":"characteristic frequencies","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C97c8dc0588c36420f091","target_concept_id":"C97c8dc0588c36420f091","target_zh":"小波能量谱","target_en":"wavelet energy spectrum","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C20a7dedc19cf306c7073","target_concept_id":"C20a7dedc19cf306c7073","target_zh":"小波系数","target_en":"wavelet coefficients","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C1662045a471dc4c9dd4e","target_concept_id":"C1662045a471dc4c9dd4e","target_zh":"概率方法","target_en":"probabilistic method","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_concept_id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_zh":"车体振动","target_en":"car-body vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[{"id":"signal.time-frequency","label":"信号与时频分析"}],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"},{"id":"P121","title":"基于小波的轨道不平顺和车体振动响应分析","authors":"宁迎智,周小林,徐庆元,徐磊,孟艺宸","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.03.006","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"宁迎智等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-and-car-body-vibration-response-based-on-wavelet-transform"}]}